	(gr_text "Keep going Isaac, It may be hard\nyes... you might not want to do it.\nBut remember God trusts you\nThey trust you\nand stop once in a while to see around you\nplease, I know you want to be on top of the world \nbut that's not the final goal\nbe grateful and keep being yourself\ndo not let the devil dominate you, and be better\njust a little everyday. "
		(at 93.299087 90.48495 0)
		(layer "F.SilkS")
		(uuid "e38b0535-1093-4567-b322-6da56f53cf20")
		(effects
